{"step_index":2287,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:38:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-23T17:38:09-04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-23T17:38:09-04:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts`\nTotal Lines: 152\nTotal Bytes: 8235\nShowing lines 71 to 152\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n71: 5. NEVER Cut Off / Complete Thought: The message MUST be complete, grammatically sound, and end with an easy-to-answer closing question.\n72: 6. Length: Concise mobile length (around 2 to 4 sentences).\n73: 7. Format: Output ONLY the plain SMS text. Do NOT include quotation marks, markdown bolding, or intro/outro explanations.\n74: `;\n75: \n76:       const candidateModels = await GeminiModelService.getActiveModels(key);\n77: \n78:       for (const model of candidateModels) {\n79:         try {\n80:           const endpoint = `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/${model}:generateContent?key=${key}`;\n81: \n82:           const response = await fetch(endpoint, {\n83:             method: 'POST',\n84:             headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n85:             body: JSON.stringify({\n86:               contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }],\n87:               generationConfig: {\n88:                 temperature: 0.35,\n89:                 maxOutputTokens: 600,\n90:               },\n91:             }),\n92:           });\n93: \n94:           if (response.ok) {\n95:             const data = await response.json();\n96:             const text = data?.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text?.trim();\n97:             if (text && text.length > 20) {\n98:               return text.replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, '').trim();\n99:             }\n100:           }\n101:         } catch {\n102:           // Attempt next model\n103:         }\n104:       }\n105:     } catch (e) {\n106:       console.warn('AI SMS generation failed, using intelligent fallback:', e);\n107:     }\n108: \n109:     return this.getSmartFallbackSMS(lead, agentName, toneFocus);\n110:   }\n111: \n112:   /**\n113:    * Generates a fully customized, professional fallback SMS if the AI API is unreachable.\n114:    */\n115:   private static getSmartFallbackSMS(\n116:     lead: Lead,\n117:     agentName: string = 'Alex',\n118:     toneFocus?: string\n119:   ): string {\n120:     const firstName = lead.name ? lead.name.split(' ')[0] : 'there';\n121:     const school = lead.school || 'your school';\n122:     const planning = lead.planning_period || 'your planning period';\n123:     const room = lead.room_number ? ` in Room ${lead.room_number}` : '';\n124:     const hasQuestion = lead.custom_questions && lead.custom_questions.trim().length > 0;\n125:     const hasNotes = lead.notes && lead.notes.trim().length > 0;\n126:     const questionText = hasQuestion ? lead.custom_questions!.trim() : hasNotes ? lead.notes!.trim() : '';\n127: \n128:     const prefSlot =\n129:       lead.meeting_preferences && lead.meeting_preferences.length > 0\n130:         ? lead.meeting_preferences[0].replace(/^[0-9]\\.\\s*/, '')\n131:         : `during ${planning}`;\n132: \n133:     // Case 1: Teacher wrote a specific handwritten note or question\n134:     if (questionText) {\n135:       return `Hi ${firstName}, this is ${agentName} with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${school} and saw your note regarding \"${questionText}\". I'll be on campus this week and would love to review your exact numbers—does ${prefSlot} work for a quick sit-down during ${planning}${room}?`;\n136:     }\n137: \n138:     // Case 2: High years of service / DROP focus\n139:     if (lead.years_in_frs && parseInt(lead.years_in_frs, 10) >= 15) {\n140:       return `Hi ${firstName}, this is ${agentName} with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${school} regarding your ${lead.years_in_frs} years of service and DROP options. I'll be visiting campus this week—does ${prefSlot} work for a quick sit-down during ${planning}${room}?`;\n141:     }\n142: \n143:     // Case 3: 5% Bonus or 403(b) focus\n144:     if (toneFocus === 'drop_bonus_focus' || (lead.frs_interests && lead.frs_interests.some((i) => i.includes('Bonus') || i.includes('403')))) {\n145:       return `Hi ${firstName}, this is ${agentName} with ValuTeachers. Following up on your FRS Report Card from ${school} regarding your 403(b) options and the 5% bonus. I'll be at the school this week—does ${prefSlot} work for a quick classroom sit-down during ${planning}${room}?`;\n146:     }\n147: \n148:     // Default friendly & professional sit-down invitation\n149:     return `Hi ${firstName}, this is ${agentName} with ValuTeachers. I have your handwritten FRS Report Card from ${school} and wanted to help review your state pension and retirement options. I'll be on campus this week—does ${prefSlot} work for a quick sit-down during ${planning}${room}?`;\n150:   }\n151: }\n152: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
