{"step_index":2292,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:38:28Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Resolution of the iPhone 14 header wrapping bug and comprehensive line-by-line codebase audit results.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Mobile Screen Header Alignment & Full Codebase Audit\n\n## 1. Header Layout Alignment on iPhone 14 Portrait\n- **The Issue:** On standard iPhone 14 viewport width (~390px), the 5 header icons pushed against `titleArea`, causing `\"SnapDialer\"` to split and wrap the trailing `\"r\"` onto a second line.\n- **The Fix:**\n  - Added strict single-line enforcement: `<Text style={styles.appTitle} numberOfLines={1}>SnapDialer</Text>` and `<Text style={styles.appSubtitle} numberOfLines={1} ellipsizeMode=\"tail\">`.\n  - Added `flexShrink: 0`, `marginRight: 8`, and `fontSize: 21` with `fontWeight: '900'`.\n  - Rebalanced `headerIcons` container with `justifyContent: 'flex-end'`, `gap: 5`, and compact `snapHeaderButton` dimensions (`paddingHorizontal: 10, paddingVertical: 6`).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Line-by-Line & Module-by-Module Codebase Audit Results\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        COMPREHENSIVE AUDIT REPORT                      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ • ListsScreen.tsx         ➔ Header wrapping fixed, duplicate imports    │\n│                             cleaned, campus filters audited            │\n│ • DialerHudScreen.tsx     ➔ Header subtitle single-line guard,         │\n│                             safe null guards on notes & images         │\n│ • PlanningHeatmapScreen   ➔ Safe planning period parsing, title guards │\n│ • CalendarService.ts      ➔ Safe Date instance check & RFC 5545 escape │\n│ • CsvService.ts           ➔ Safe date parser & Excel BOM formatting    │\n│ • AiSmsService.ts         ➔ Dynamic model cascade & robust fallback    │\n│ • LeadsRepository.ts      ➔ Transaction safety & campus queue filters  │\n│ • IndexedDbStorage.ts     ➔ Multi-GB persistence lock & safe migration │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Live Production Deployment\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n","Description":"Update walkthrough.md with header fix and codebase audit details","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
