{"step_index":2294,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:38:32Z","content":"### 🛠️ Header Alignment Fixed & Comprehensive Codebase Audit Completed!\n\n---\n\n### 1. 📱 SnapDialer Header Title Fix on iPhone 14 (Portrait Mode)\n- **Root Cause:** On standard mobile viewport widths (~390px for iPhone 14), the 5 header action buttons (`Snap Card`, `Calendar`, `Download`, `Analytics`, `Settings`) consumed ~280px, compressing the title container down to ~78px and forcing the `'r'` in `\"SnapDialer\"` onto a second line.\n- **The Fix Applied ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)):**\n  - **Single-Line Lock:** Added `numberOfLines={1}` and `flexShrink: 0` to `<Text style={styles.appTitle}>SnapDialer</Text>` so it can **never** wrap or break across lines under any screen dimensions.\n  - **Subtitle Guard:** Added `numberOfLines={1}` and `ellipsizeMode=\"tail\"` to `ValuTeachers • FRS Pipeline`.\n  - **Ergonomic Rebalance:** Refined `snapHeaderButton` and icon padding (`gap: 5`, `padding: 4`) with `justifyContent: 'flex-end'`, ensuring the title container maintains full dedicated width.\n\n---\n\n### 2. 🔍 Line-by-Line & Module-by-Module Codebase Audit\n\n| Module / File | Area Audited | Result & Enhancements Applied |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **[`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)** | Header Layout & Filters | Fixed title line-break, removed duplicate imports, verified campus filter combination with search queries. |\n| **[`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)** | Cockpit HUD & Modals | Added `numberOfLines={1}` to queue counter & campaign title; added null checks on proof images, card notes, and timer cleanup on unmount. |\n| **[`PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx)** | Bell Schedule Grid | Added title single-line guards, safe period matching (Period 1–7 + After School), and direct dial/detail touch-handling. |\n| **[`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)** | Detail & Calendar Piping | Verified 1-tap Apple (`.ics`), Google Calendar, and Outlook piping with safe note interpolations. |\n| **[`CalendarService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/calendarService.ts)** | Calendar Event Engine | Added `Date` instance validity checks (`!isNaN(date.getTime())`), safe string escaping per RFC 5545, and 15-min pre-alarms. |\n| **[`CsvService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/csvService.ts)** | Two-Way CSV Pipeline | Added safe date parsers (`formatDateSafe`), UTF-8 Excel BOM (`\\ufeff`), and quote escaping for CSV exports/imports. |\n| **[`AiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts)** | Gemini Text Drafter | Verified dynamic model discovery, handwriting OCR acknowledgment, and offline fallback generator. |\n| **[`leadsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/leadsRepository.ts)** | Query & Queue Logic | Audited `getAllSchools`, `getDialingQueueForSchool`, batch import transaction safety, and priority tier sort orders. |\n| **[`indexedDbStorage.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/indexedDbStorage.ts)** | Multi-GB Database | Verified persistent storage locking (`navigator.storage.persist()`), transaction integrity, and crash recovery. |\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Production Deployment\nThe build has been exported and deployed live to Surge:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
